This is a Full-Time Role (40 hours per week, 5DWW) with no option for part-time work. While this is a remote-first opportunity, the candidate filling this role must be a resident of the Netherlands, the U.K., Brazil, Pennsylvania, New York, or the District of Columbia at the start of employment. Additionally, they must be within commuting distance of our office in Amsterdam, London, São Paulo, Philadelphia, New York City, or Washington.&nbsp;
Please visit&nbsp; our Careers page to review all opportunities and submit your application for the role(s) that best fit your location and work authorization.

